cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these materials, please cite the software replication package. Cite the accompanying manuscript separately if published."
title: "Finite-Sample Confirmation of an Increase–Decrease–Increase Pattern in Cubic Regression — Replication Materials"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Düzgün"
    given-names: "Onur"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-6288-6141"
version: "0.1.0"
url: "https://github.com/oduzgun/cubic-pattern-confirmation-replication"
abstract: >-
  Curated source code, fixed numerical protocols and frozen results for two
  Monte Carlo studies (P03/P04; 192,000 replications) of finite-sample
  confirmation procedures for a strict increase-decrease-increase pattern
  in correctly specified Gaussian cubic regression.
keywords:
  - cubic regression
  - shape-restricted inference
  - turning points
  - intersection-union tests
  - finite-sample inference
  - Monte Carlo simulation
